---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Homepage">
	<section class="hero">
		<h1>Welcome to Ashlar Tech Solutions</h1>
		<p class="tagline">
			We provide the infrastructure, tools, and expertise to help you thrive in a digital world. 
			Whether you're scaling a business or streamlining your home, we make technology work for you—not the other way around.
		</p>
		<a href="/contact" class="cta-button">Elevate Your Tech Experience</a>
	</section>

	<section class="philosophy">
		<div class="philosophy-content">
			<h3>Our Foundation</h3>
			<p>
				We believe technology should be a solid foundation, not a fractured burden. 
				We combine technical rigor with a human-centric approach to ensure your systems are as reliable as they are advanced.
			</p>
			<p>
				We see your business or organization as a grand structure. Each system—your network, your software, your hardware—is a stone in that building. 
				If the stones are rough and irregular, the foundation becomes unstable. We specialize in smoothing those edges, 
				ensuring every piece of your technology fits together perfectly to support your mission.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="feature-grid">
		<div class="feature-card">
			<h3>Managed Support</h3>
			<p>
				Reliable IT support tailored for organizations. We handle the "tech headaches" so your team can focus on what they do best. 
				From troubleshooting to long-term maintenance, we ensure your operations remain uninterrupted.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="feature-card">
			<h3>Strategic Growth</h3>
			<p>
				We don't just build websites; we develop high-converting digital storefronts designed to attract and retain your ideal customers. 
				Stay ahead of the curve with resources designed to teach motivated individuals the latest industry standards.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 5rem 1rem;
		background: #f9fafb;
		border-radius: 24px;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
	}

	h1 {
		font-size: 3rem;
		color: #111827;
		margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
	}

	.tagline {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		max-width: 800px;
		margin: 0 auto 2rem;
		color: #4b5563;
	}

	.cta-button {
		display: inline-block;
		background: #3245ff;
		color: white;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		text-decoration: none;
		font-weight: 600;
		transition: all 0.2s ease;
	}

	.cta-button:hover {
		background: #bc52ee;
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.philosophy {
		background: white;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
		border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
		border-radius: 20px;
		margin-bottom: 4rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.philosophy-content {
		max-width: 750px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.feature-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 2rem;
	}

	.feature-card {
		padding: 2.5rem;
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
		border-radius: 16px;
		transition: border-color 0.3s;
	}

	.feature-card:hover {
		border-color: #3245ff;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.feature-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		h1 {
			font-size: 2.25rem;
		}
	}
</style>
